Package: dbmm
Title: Dynamic Bayesian Measurement Models
Description: Fits dynamic Bayesian measurement models using Stan via the
    'cmdstanr' package. Two models are supported: a dynamic factor model for
    indicators of mixed type (binary, ordinal, or metric), and a
    multidimensional ordinal dynamic group-level item response theory
    (MODGIRT) model. Both allow for multiple latent factors, and both provide
    helpers for shaping data, imposing post-estimation identification
    restrictions, and summarizing draws.
Version: 0.0.1.9000
